# portfolio Development Guidelines

Auto-generated from all feature plans. Last updated: 2026-03-22

## Active Technologies

- JavaScript (ES2020+), React 19 + Next.js 16 (App Router), Tailwind CSS 3.4, shadcn-style UI (`components/ui`, `tailwindcss-animate`, `cn()` helper), `framer-motion`, `react-icons` as used today (001-ui-refactor-timeline)

## Project Structure

```text
app/                     # App Router; route-specific UI under app/(site)/<segment>/
components/              # Shared UI: layout/, experience/, not-found/, other/, ui/
constants/               # Data (projects, nav, timeline, features)
images/                  # Bundled images (referenced from constants and components)
lib/                     # Small utilities (e.g. assetUrl)
public/                  # Static files (resume PDF, robots.txt, etc.)
```

## Commands

npm test && npm run lint

